%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry, but I can't.\d%K%P
「抱歉…果然还是办不到啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHey, what are you doing?!\d%K%P
「喂，你干什么呢！？」%K%P
After she heard my response, Toko silently opened her\npurse and took a few coins out of it.%K%P
都子见问不出我的话，\n便随手拿起钱包打开，取出了一枚硬币。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere, have a hundred yen.\nYou think that's enough for ten minutes?\d%K%P
「给你１００元。\n这抵得上１０分钟了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm not a coin-operated TV in a hotel, okay?!\d%K%P
「又不是宾馆的付费电视！？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI want an uncut version.\nHere you go, thirty minutes.\d%K%P
「放送未删节版吧。\n给你，３０分钟的钱」%K%P
She was actually offering me a little more than most\naverage TV programs would cost, too...%K%P
倒是比一般付费点播的价格更高就是了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, really. That isn't the problem here...\d%K%P
「不，所以说，不是钱的问题啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're pretty good, Osamu. Never knew you had such a\nknack for haggling... Here, a thousand yen.\d%K%P
「还真不赖啊理君。\n这么会坐地起价…来给你１０００元」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI just told you, that isn't the problem here!\d%K%P
「我都说了不是钱的问题了！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, if you insist. Guess I'll have to tighten my purse\nstrings this month. ...Five thousand yen.\d%K%P
「没办法了，这个月的生活费不要了。\n…五千元」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dLook, let's stop this, Toko... It's not like any of this\nwill...\d%K%P
「别这样，都子…\n就算你这样做，我也」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't have any cash left, so I'll write you a check.\nI'll even throw in free food for all of next month.\d%K%P
「因为没有现金了之后说的先欠着。\n下个月全部的伙食费」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dFor the last time, I'm not telling you!\d%K%P
「不是让你别再说了么！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow about waiving your rent for a month, then?\d%K%P
「顺带免你一个月的房租」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dListen to me!\d%K%P
「喂喂！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWaiving your rent for a year.\d%K%P
「一年房租」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPlease stop...\d%K%P
「别再说了…啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWaiving your rent for life. I doubt I'll be able to go on\nliving like this.\d%K%P
「一辈子的房租。\n哎，明天我也许就活不下去了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
The moment Toko brought up rent... in other words, the\nmoment I let out my first squeak was when the fight was\nset.%K%P
都子说不收房租的时候…\n也就是在我的语气开始变化的时候，胜负就已经清楚了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI told you, didn't I?\nThat I'd sulk if there was something I didn't like.\d%K%P
「我说过的吧？\n以后有什么不如意的事，我就会闹别扭的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat wasn't sulking. The word \dextortion\d comes to mind,\nactually.\d%K%P
「你这可不是闹别扭。\n而是在步步紧逼啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry, Osamu.\d%K%P
「对不起啊，理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs giving me some space to breathe a part of your plan,\ntoo?\d%K%P
「…看到我退了一步，你就伺机进一步？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm quite a wild child, aren't I?\d%K%P
「我是个麻烦的孩子吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
She admitted her shortcomings, yet refused to back down.%K%P
就算承认了自己的错误，也毫不退让。%K%P
This girl was just too shrewd... I couldn't help but be\nproud of her.%K%P
多么聪明的女儿啊，真让我感到骄傲…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dJust... don't tell anyone.\d%K%P
「只跟你说…跟别人不要说啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOkay.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
